From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: maplibre-plugins <sync@localhost>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 19:14:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] Carry plugin frame queries

Lets a source-free plugin layer return GeoJSON features with world-pixel
hit envelopes each frame, indexed through the native dynamic feature index
so rendered-feature queries hit them. Not yet proposed upstream.

Carried by maplibre-plugins until it lands upstream.
