+`0032-plugin-frame-queries.patch` adds source-free feature snapshots to the
+plugin ABI. Frame queries use the native dynamic feature index and copy the
+plugin's GeoJSON and world-pixel envelopes. This patch is local-only: it is
+not upstreamed, and no upstream PR exists.
+
 Each patch is a squashed diff applied on top of the patches before it. Patch
 context and test placement follow the pinned source and earlier patches. The
 publication patch includes the transition setters for our bearing-accuracy
